[Music]  hello there  season six of fortnite arrived and with  it came a new bunch of myths that need  to be chased and potentially busted  if you have a myth you'd like us to test  please pop it in the comments below and  upvote your favorites  in this episode we'll be taking animals  to the launch pads at the spires  hiding cuttlefish in secret places and  seeing if pigs  really can fly so sit your butt down for  10 minutes slap code adamaru in the  store to help out my nonsense and let's  do this  let's chase some myths a very simple one  to begin with  what happens if you upgrade a weapon  while holding  a spire orb so the new mechanic this  season is to collect parts to upgrade  weapons  to show this upgrade our character whips  out a hammer and bashes their hand  so we're going to do that but with  aspire orb which just in case you've  been living under a rock  can be obtained by defeating aspire  assassin  so now the moment of truth here's a  weapon upgrade whilst holding a knob  yep that's right the orb is used as a  hammer  great ball control penny so we tried  this with other holdable items  and the one you need to see is a chicken  i can't explain this  but i quite like it please don't patch  it out epic  i think we need to move on to those  cuddle fish pink ticking time bombs with  a proximity sensor  these things are seriously overpowered  and make for interesting plays  a few things to quickly note the  cuttlefish can't be attached to  teammates  they bounce off that happens with tamed  animals too but don't worry we found a  bunch of great ways to use them  starting with this myth from straight  out to cornwall  cuttlefish can be used in a drive-by so  let's try it we set up iron man to sweep  the streets clean  and placed cuttlefish on the side of our  ride we drove past  at top speed no slowing down at all the  hope was the cuttlefish would be  triggered by the enemy when passing by  and here's what happens  okay that is impressive the cuttlefish  activate as intended  but the delay in jumping to the enemy  means the vehicle can be a safe distance  away before they explode  officially the cleanest drive-by in  fortnite history  with zero evidence left behind unless  they don't die  then then you need to shoot them let's  take this upper level  burns asks can cuttlefish be thrown  through  car windows great myth hiding cuttlefish  inside vehicles so we jumped in a car  and smashed the windows with our faces  we then tossed in a few cuddle fish we  hit a failure moment here as the  cuttlefish simply stick to the windows  even when they're non-existent this myth  was busted  but wait we remembered the windscreens  could be removed with a few bullets  could a cuttlefish be thrown through  here hell yeah it can  the cuttlefish can exist inside any  vehicle and should an enemy decide to  jump in  eventually boom  a self-contained explosive we tried this  a few times and if the cuttlefish  are well hidden this tactic is actually  viable  we also noticed that if the enemy came  close but didn't get in the vehicle  the cuttlefish would leap towards them  repeatedly but remain stuck  inside the car in a later test the  cuttlefish inside the car  still jumped out of a moving vehicle so  we could still perform a drive by  so a few grey areas to note but in terms  of a meme strat  this method of hiding cuddle fish is  worth a try  next myth from aaron  who asks can cuddle fish be hidden  inside hiding spots  hiding those pink blobs in the loo the  haystacks and the trash  this one is pretty easy to check when a  teammate opened a potter potty  i threw in a cuddle fish and for a  moment it went  inside and this looked like a success  but  a few moments later the fish explodes  regardless of who's around  on other hiding spots the fish sticks  out openly and becomes too obvious  so this is a busted myth  here is a great myth will animals  use the spire boost pods i hope this is  proven good  at six spots on the season six map are  broken spires  with a launch boost pad sort of thing at  the very top  they are great for rotating into the  next storm circle  and by the way if you haven't tried yet  use one whilst holding a chicken  it's mind-blowing but for this one we  need a wolf  i quickly tamed a wolf and took him to  the spire and lo and behold what  happened  he loved it he's having so much fun i  sat here for 30 minutes watching this  guy  he never stopped true legend quickly  moving on the next myth is from a ton of  you guys who ask  can a vehicle be rifted for this one we  jumped into a private game and quickly  earned the gold to buy a rift  from raz i tried to buy the rift from  the back seat of the truck  but alas now we can't do that this  season so another approach was needed i  stood as close as i could to the vehicle  my teammates and the npc  and look what happened when a rift is  purchased  everyone except raz is dragged into the  air even the vehicle you're in  there is absolutely no reason to do this  in game but this is what we do here  completely pointless myths ggs everyone  now for another myth which we all want  to be true and again helps nobody at all  can an animal rock it right so many  people asked for this  so i started with the ball i used a  crash mat to bounce him up in the air  and took  pot shots  as you can see it technically works but  almost immediately the bar falls off  again  i think we need at least two seconds of  flight time to confirm this myth  this was my second strat i tamed the  ball and walked him up a ramp  and then quickly edited and dropped down  below to do this  the boar is officially rocket riding  pigs do  fly the journey comes to an abrupt end  with a bang  and without realizing we also chased a  new myth do  animals take fall damage  i can say with quite a lot of confidence  no they don't  we turned our attention to the wolf  species and this was somehow way more  simple  i once again threw down the crash mat  and we took turns to fire the beast into  orbit  and then it was my goal  it's totally possible and this is one  thing you must do before the season ends  it should be an achievement it's a shame  the replay file stutters like this but  it was enjoyable to watch  the wolf leave the atmosphere  [Music]  the brand new remote amazing cube landed  in the stall this season  a rubik's cube remote which got many of  us thinking  is it possible to complete the cube this  isn't a huge stretch to be honest the  bottle cap kiki moat had a percentage  chance of success and so did the burpee  emote of changing to a literal burp  and the hula hoop one too so what about  the amazing cube  for this one i jumped into battle labs  for three hours and left my game running  when i returned penny was still trying  to solve the cube  checking back on the replay file shows  over the three hours she never manages  it  and from closer inspection the cube  doesn't change at  all the same blue purple orange and pink  blocks  can be seen at the end of every  animation in the same order  so this is 99 confirmed to be a busted  myth  we aren't clever enough to beat the  amazing cube just yet  but i wouldn't put it past epic to  update the emote with a tiny chance of  success  i'll be sure to keep checking it over  the season anyway let's crack on  before our last myth take this one moon  key man says  myth can you kill someone by throwing  the orb i tried  nothing happened we cannot eliminate  each other with the spire orbs they  simply travel through the person's body  but we can have fun playing catch happy  fun times  and now our final myth antoni dim asks  myth  what happens if you lure an animal into  the steamy stacks cooling towers  let's do this i started by taking my  favorite wolf to the stacks  and to cut a long story short this  happens  absolutely nothing the wolf roams around  openly on the purple stuff  next we take the chicken over i was  confident the chicken would fly into the  air due to their wings  but alas it's another busted myth rip  the dream  to make this a full house i took a bar  over and watched them fight to the death  in the purple coliseum  the wolf attacked the chicken the bar  attacked the chicken the chicken chased  them both away but in the end the wolf  took the dub  like there was any doubt so there we  have it another bunch of myths chased  busted and confirmed in season six of  chapter two  thanks for sticking around to the end  and an extra special thanks to these  guys  who rocked my code this week code  adamaru thank you very much much  appreciated  i'm adam from playstation grenade it's  been a pleasure see you next time  [Music]

